WEBVTT

00:01:56.850 --> 00:01:58.510
Really...

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:00.880
...this recession.

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:04.400
Isn't Nee-chan going to work today?

00:02:04.870 --> 00:02:05.740
It doesn't look like it.

00:02:06.570 --> 00:02:09.590
I guess fewer people go to beauty salons during a recession.

00:02:12.470 --> 00:02:13.610
Hey, Reiko.

00:02:13.610 --> 00:02:15.220
Don't get so angry in the morning.

00:02:15.740 --> 00:02:17.160
Have some dried sardines.

00:02:17.540 --> 00:02:17.950
Here.

00:02:18.110 --> 00:02:19.150
Thanks.

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:24.090
As long as she doesn't take it out on me...

00:02:33.570 --> 00:02:36.120
Yuzuyu-chan, do you want me to brush your hair?

00:02:36.520 --> 00:02:37.830
Huh?  Is that okay?

00:02:38.650 --> 00:02:39.340
It's fine.

00:02:39.800 --> 00:02:40.420
Of course it is.

00:02:49.940 --> 00:02:51.200
There, all done.

00:02:59.720 --> 00:03:02.030
I look like a princess, don't I?

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:06.460
But they're just braids...

00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:11.290
Yuzuyu.

00:03:13.090 --> 00:03:13.890
It's time to go.

00:03:14.220 --> 00:03:14.990
Okay.

00:03:16.520 --> 00:03:19.040
Your lunch today is Chinjao Roast.

00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:20.960
Ch-Chi...?

00:03:27.210 --> 00:03:30.610
Kippei, that's my best scarf!

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:32.730
The sauce is leaking.

00:03:34.120 --> 00:03:36.060
How dare you!

00:03:36.260 --> 00:03:36.690
Okay!

00:03:37.310 --> 00:03:39.480
Kippei! Why you...

00:03:40.210 --> 00:03:41.590
Are you angry again?

00:03:41.930 --> 00:03:42.730
Here, have some more sardines.

00:03:47.520 --> 00:03:48.550
That was close.

00:03:49.130 --> 00:03:51.090
Nee-chan was about to punch me.

00:03:51.450 --> 00:03:51.970
Punch?

00:03:52.420 --> 00:03:53.990
Well, shall we go?

00:04:15.850 --> 00:04:16.380
Alright.

00:04:16.920 --> 00:04:18.000
You didn't forget anything, right?

00:04:19.380 --> 00:04:20.340
Nope.

00:04:20.770 --> 00:04:21.460
Alright!

00:04:21.810 --> 00:04:22.900
Have fun then.

00:04:23.340 --> 00:04:25.060
Okay.  I'm on my way.

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:27.340
Good morning.

00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:29.640
Good morning, Yuzuyu-chan.

00:04:37.520 --> 00:04:38.420
No way!

00:04:38.730 --> 00:04:40.430
Ten yen... Ten yen...

00:04:41.740 --> 00:04:42.870
I'm short by ten yen...

00:04:43.930 --> 00:04:45.420
Does anybody have ten yen?

00:04:47.350 --> 00:04:48.380
Hey, can I borrow ten yen?

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:50.570
Come on, please?  Just ten yen.  Let me borrow it.

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:52.250
Why?!

00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:54.410
What are you doing, Kippei?

00:04:56.170 --> 00:04:56.970
Kanayan.

00:04:57.480 --> 00:04:58.190
Lend me ten yen.

00:04:58.420 --> 00:05:00.040
You mean, "Please lend me ten yen," right?

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:05.230
Thanks.

00:05:05.630 --> 00:05:08.180
You're the only one who would lend me ten yen.

00:05:08.580 --> 00:05:10.680
Well, you're the only one who'd be short by ten yen.

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:14.390
You'd better do me a favor sometime.

00:05:14.730 --> 00:05:16.690
I will.  Whatever you need.

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:17.530
Yeah, yeah.

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:28.820
You airheads, there's no way Kippei would have a serious relationship with any of you.

00:05:32.870 --> 00:05:34.980
Has everyone finished drawing?

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:37.920
Please raise your hand when you've finished.

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:40.530
Oh, Yuzuyu-chan.

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:42.220
That's a very good drawing.

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:43.380
Really?

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:45.240
I like drawing.

00:05:45.620 --> 00:05:46.940
Are you going to give it to someone?

00:05:47.390 --> 00:05:48.070
Well...

00:05:48.500 --> 00:05:50.240
I'm going to get even better.

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:54.050
Then I'm going to draw a lot for Kippei-onii-chan.

00:05:54.390 --> 00:05:55.160
I see.

00:05:55.430 --> 00:05:58.300
I'm sure he'll be very happy.

00:05:58.980 --> 00:05:59.490
Yep!

00:06:00.010 --> 00:06:01.610
Sensei, I'm finished!

00:06:01.740 --> 00:06:02.520
Okay.

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:03.690
Hey, hey.

00:06:04.620 --> 00:06:07.720
Is his name Kippei-san?

00:06:09.100 --> 00:06:10.780
Yeah, Kippei-onii-chan.

00:06:12.410 --> 00:06:14.100
Kippei-san, huh?

00:06:25.870 --> 00:06:26.550
I see.

00:06:27.190 --> 00:06:28.660
So you drew pictures today.

00:06:28.970 --> 00:06:29.390
Yep.

00:06:30.830 --> 00:06:32.310
Flowers!

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:33.860
Hey, where are you going?

00:06:35.570 --> 00:06:36.780
They're beautiful.

00:06:39.700 --> 00:06:41.260
Can I pick some flowers?

00:06:43.870 --> 00:06:45.870
They look like weeds to me...

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:48.230
Don't pick those pansies.

00:06:48.280 --> 00:06:49.070
You'll get in trouble.

00:06:49.070 --> 00:06:49.880
Okay.

00:06:56.190 --> 00:06:57.600
Ack!  It's Nee-chan.

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:01.370
Geez...

00:07:02.240 --> 00:07:05.970
Nee-chan always treats me like her slave when she isn't working.

00:07:05.970 --> 00:07:06.360
This sucks.

00:07:11.420 --> 00:07:13.070
Hey, let's go now.

00:07:13.630 --> 00:07:15.360
I don't want to!

00:07:15.540 --> 00:07:17.380
I want to play more!

00:07:19.320 --> 00:07:21.740
The girls in our house are so selfish.

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:25.520
I have to go and buy some things.

00:07:25.520 --> 00:07:26.590
I'll be right back.

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:27.740
Wait here.

00:07:28.010 --> 00:07:28.840
Okay.

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:30.980
Don't go anywhere.

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:32.280
Okay.

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:53.080
Hey, what are you doing?

00:07:56.230 --> 00:07:57.680
Picking flowers?

00:07:58.540 --> 00:07:58.940
Yes.

00:07:59.770 --> 00:08:00.770
That looks like fun.

00:08:00.770 --> 00:08:01.720
Can I join you?

00:08:01.910 --> 00:08:02.650
Sure.

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:09.900
Aren't they beautiful?

00:08:10.450 --> 00:08:10.890
Yes.

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:13.470
Beautiful.

00:08:23.360 --> 00:08:23.840
Look!

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:26.200
They're the same color as my crayon.

00:08:27.720 --> 00:08:29.290
Um... Pink!

00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:31.050
That's true.

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:33.550
Say...

00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:37.300
The Katakura's aren't your family, are they?

00:08:44.470 --> 00:08:46.770
Why are you living with them?

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:53.830
You see, my mama...

00:08:54.150 --> 00:08:56.810
She left me there and then disappeared.

00:08:58.030 --> 00:08:58.810
Oh?

00:09:00.690 --> 00:09:07.290
So Kippei-onii-chan makes my lunches for me instead.

00:09:10.970 --> 00:09:13.120
Are you two always together?

00:09:13.920 --> 00:09:14.360
Yes.

00:09:15.300 --> 00:09:17.830
We eat and sleep together.

00:09:21.520 --> 00:09:24.350
I love Kippei-onii-chan!

00:09:28.140 --> 00:09:30.020
How pitiful...

00:09:34.080 --> 00:09:36.780
So thats why everyone is so kind to you.

00:09:40.740 --> 00:09:41.500
But...

00:09:42.570 --> 00:09:45.440
the truth is, everyone hates you!

00:09:56.700 --> 00:09:58.130
That's why your parents...

00:10:00.190 --> 00:10:01.930
...abandoned you.

00:10:23.190 --> 00:10:24.590
What are you doing?

00:10:26.450 --> 00:10:27.460
Just who do you think you are?

00:10:44.240 --> 00:10:46.840
You'll be just fine.

00:10:49.610 --> 00:10:50.550
Onee-chan.

00:10:54.910 --> 00:10:56.720
Huh?  It's you, Tokunaga.

00:10:57.530 --> 00:10:58.310
What's going on?

00:10:58.600 --> 00:10:59.480
Why are you two...

00:11:10.590 --> 00:11:11.940
You're leaving?

00:11:13.660 --> 00:11:14.660
What was that about?

00:11:15.920 --> 00:11:16.610
What's wrong?

00:11:18.290 --> 00:11:19.670
Kippei-onii-chan.

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:21.930
Yuzuyu.

00:11:27.500 --> 00:11:28.260
Do you want to go home?

00:11:29.860 --> 00:11:30.640
Are you done picking flowers?

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:32.110
Yes.

00:11:33.730 --> 00:11:34.340
Okay then.

00:11:35.370 --> 00:11:36.040
Let's go.

00:11:40.320 --> 00:11:40.700
Here.

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:56.180
How pitiful...

00:11:56.180 --> 00:11:59.000
The truth is, everyone hates you!

00:11:59.000 --> 00:12:00.620
That's why your parents...

00:12:00.620 --> 00:12:02.620
abandoned you.

00:12:44.650 --> 00:12:47.590
The truth, is everyone hates you!

00:12:47.590 --> 00:12:49.160
That's why your parents...

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:51.180
abandoned you.

00:12:59.790 --> 00:13:01.010
Kippei-onii-chan?

00:13:27.950 --> 00:13:30.030
Satsuki, you reek of nattou.

00:13:30.730 --> 00:13:31.670
You're up.

00:13:35.320 --> 00:13:36.890
Come on, hurry up and get dressed.

00:13:37.770 --> 00:13:38.430
Okay!

00:13:46.410 --> 00:13:47.700
Today's lunch is a good one.

00:13:48.540 --> 00:13:48.950
Yeah.

00:14:06.600 --> 00:14:07.130
Alright.

00:14:07.660 --> 00:14:08.540
You didn't forget anything, did you?

00:14:09.120 --> 00:14:09.840
No.

00:14:10.230 --> 00:14:10.800
Okay.

00:14:16.920 --> 00:14:18.280
Kippei-onii-chan.

00:14:19.360 --> 00:14:20.550
I don't want you to go.

00:14:23.330 --> 00:14:24.880
What is it?  What's wrong?

00:14:34.190 --> 00:14:37.420
I'll be back soon, so be a good girl.

00:14:42.020 --> 00:14:42.660
Okay.

00:14:54.430 --> 00:14:54.990
Tokunaga.

00:14:56.420 --> 00:14:58.320
So, you know Yuzuyu-chan?

00:14:59.070 --> 00:14:59.830
Since when?

00:15:00.770 --> 00:15:02.720
Could you not lean over like that?

00:15:04.860 --> 00:15:07.550
Do you know what happened to her yesterday?

00:15:10.770 --> 00:15:12.910
She's been acting very strange since then.

00:15:14.120 --> 00:15:15.270
She usually smiles more.

00:15:17.490 --> 00:15:18.440
I don't know.

00:15:19.060 --> 00:15:21.120
I didn't see it all.

00:15:22.840 --> 00:15:23.570
Stingy!

00:15:24.290 --> 00:15:25.820
You must know something.

00:15:26.050 --> 00:15:28.050
Come on.  Tell me!

00:15:28.240 --> 00:15:29.660
Please, anything.  Come on!

00:15:29.660 --> 00:15:30.030
Please!

00:15:30.500 --> 00:15:31.240
Come on.

00:15:37.960 --> 00:15:38.850
What?

00:15:39.010 --> 00:15:40.930
Yuzuyu-chan is acting strangely?

00:15:41.110 --> 00:15:41.550
Yeah.

00:15:42.690 --> 00:15:45.620
How would you know?

00:15:45.980 --> 00:15:48.080
But I'm looking for advice.

00:15:48.280 --> 00:15:49.480
Why won't you take me seriously?

00:15:50.070 --> 00:15:53.430
Yuzuyu has definitely been acting strangely.

00:15:54.010 --> 00:15:56.100
Maybe you're not doing a good job of taking care of her.

00:15:56.300 --> 00:15:58.770
Kids grow up by watching their parents.

00:16:00.130 --> 00:16:02.020
Then, your parent...

00:16:03.260 --> 00:16:04.880
You need to straighten up!

00:16:05.880 --> 00:16:08.940
It's your fault that I'm like this!

00:16:10.070 --> 00:16:11.080
Ouch...

00:16:11.640 --> 00:16:14.070
You shouldn't blame other people.

00:16:14.480 --> 00:16:15.310
What the...

00:16:15.480 --> 00:16:17.420
This family should just split up!

00:16:17.530 --> 00:16:18.710
Hey, Kippei!

00:16:18.710 --> 00:16:19.720
How could you say that?!

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:21.860
Your father is doing his best, you know?

00:16:22.850 --> 00:16:24.360
What are you talking about?!

00:16:24.420 --> 00:16:26.260
This is all your fault, Nee-chan!

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:27.010
You idiot!

00:16:27.810 --> 00:16:29.800
It's so lively today.  How nice.

00:16:30.070 --> 00:16:31.930
You think so too, right dear?

00:16:32.020 --> 00:16:32.970
Mmm-hmm.

00:16:36.130 --> 00:16:37.310
What are you talking about?!

00:16:37.310 --> 00:16:39.150
You idiot!  Stupid, stupid, stupid!

00:16:39.150 --> 00:16:40.710
It's because you're not attentive enough!

00:16:41.010 --> 00:16:44.020
You don't understand how I feel, do you?!

00:16:44.720 --> 00:16:46.880
You're really making me mad!

00:16:47.790 --> 00:16:50.020
Shut up!  Stop being so selfish!

00:16:50.200 --> 00:16:51.400
Kippei!

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:53.720
Okay, that's enough you two.

00:16:54.220 --> 00:16:56.580
Yuzuyu-chan just went out by herself.

00:16:58.620 --> 00:16:59.450
Went out?

00:17:00.110 --> 00:17:00.490
Yep.

00:17:01.070 --> 00:17:02.690
Why?! Where to?!

00:17:03.110 --> 00:17:03.850
I don't know.

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:05.080
You should have stopped her!

00:17:05.520 --> 00:17:08.930
I thought she's old enough to go for a walk by herself.

00:17:09.440 --> 00:17:10.420
Come on!

00:17:10.690 --> 00:17:13.350
Hurry up and go after her!

00:17:13.450 --> 00:17:14.360
I'm going!

00:17:17.370 --> 00:17:18.760
That's right.

00:17:28.510 --> 00:17:29.320
Little miss...

00:17:30.050 --> 00:17:31.490
Do you want those crayons?

00:17:35.990 --> 00:17:36.700
Can I have them?

00:17:38.730 --> 00:17:40.570
Yes, if you pay for them.

00:17:41.600 --> 00:17:43.770
I don't have any money.

00:17:44.920 --> 00:17:46.040
Then you can't have them.

00:17:47.090 --> 00:17:49.190
Come back later with your mother.

00:17:53.360 --> 00:17:54.650
Want to hang out?

00:17:56.520 --> 00:17:59.290
Where did she go?

00:17:59.730 --> 00:18:00.690
Hey, hey.

00:18:02.090 --> 00:18:03.600
You can't, miss.

00:18:04.400 --> 00:18:04.750
Eh?

00:18:07.970 --> 00:18:09.580
Mister, what are you doing?

00:18:10.140 --> 00:18:11.670
I didn't do anything.

00:18:12.120 --> 00:18:14.580
She was trying to take my merchandise.

00:18:14.650 --> 00:18:15.120
What?

00:18:24.570 --> 00:18:25.480
I'm sorry.

00:18:26.510 --> 00:18:29.730
It's okay as long as someone pays for them.

00:18:31.020 --> 00:18:31.320
Okay.

00:18:32.120 --> 00:18:34.200
Yuzuyu, give those back to him.

00:18:38.900 --> 00:18:39.480
Let's go home.

00:19:06.260 --> 00:19:06.940
Hey, Yuzuyu.

00:19:07.830 --> 00:19:08.840
Why did you do that?

00:19:12.700 --> 00:19:15.390
You have to pay for things at stores.

00:19:16.150 --> 00:19:18.550
You can't just take them.  That's stealing.

00:19:19.930 --> 00:19:20.440
Understand?

00:19:52.970 --> 00:19:53.500
Yuzuyu.

00:19:54.580 --> 00:19:55.210
What's wrong?

00:19:56.930 --> 00:19:57.860
What happened?

00:20:00.620 --> 00:20:01.910
Did I do something wrong?

00:20:04.950 --> 00:20:05.620
Then why?

00:20:06.450 --> 00:20:08.510
Why did you suddenly go out and take those crayons?

00:20:10.650 --> 00:20:11.110
Yuzu...

00:20:12.790 --> 00:20:13.250
I...

00:20:14.510 --> 00:20:15.680
wanted to draw...

00:20:16.490 --> 00:20:18.180
...for you, Kippei-onii-chan.

00:20:22.130 --> 00:20:24.850
When I drew for you...

00:20:25.310 --> 00:20:27.270
...you praised me.

00:20:28.070 --> 00:20:30.430
You'll always be by my side.

00:20:32.650 --> 00:20:33.180
Yuzu...

00:20:36.640 --> 00:20:40.100
Everyone... I don't want everyone to hate me!

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:42.990
Hey.

00:20:44.440 --> 00:20:48.490
I don't want everyone to abandon me!

00:20:49.980 --> 00:20:50.460
Yuzu!

00:21:19.980 --> 00:21:23.360
Look, I'm right here.

00:21:28.800 --> 00:21:30.340
What happened to you?

00:24:21.140 --> 00:24:21.910
What?

00:24:22.050 --> 00:24:23.800
Yuzuyu-chan is acting strangely?

00:24:23.800 --> 00:24:24.990
That's right.

00:24:24.990 --> 00:24:26.150
She was crying like crazy.

00:24:26.390 --> 00:24:28.110
What should I do?

00:24:28.110 --> 00:24:29.450
Get a hold of yourself, Kippei.

00:24:29.630 --> 00:24:32.440
You're all Yuzuyu-chan has.

00:24:32.550 --> 00:24:33.730
Yeah.  I'll work hard!

00:24:34.250 --> 00:24:36.790
Hey, does anyone know who this girl is?

00:24:37.470 --> 00:24:39.730
What?  Kokoro-chan, do you know something?

00:24:40.700 --> 00:24:42.300
Next time on Aishiteruze Baby:

00:24:42.550 --> 00:24:43.560
The Reason for Her Tears

00:24:44.080 --> 00:24:45.810
Are you the one who made Yuzu cry?!
